      "created_at": "2015-09-12T23:11:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can you unlock variants in Multi-player? &nbsp;If yes, does everyone (who's eligible) get it? &nbsp;If no, why not? &nbsp;I ask mostly because when people are brainstorming hard to get new variants, it would be awesome if folks could get together in a multi-player game and cram, and (of course) all get the rewards if successful.</p>",
