      "created_at": "2015-09-13T11:40:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Obviously there would be exceptions like America's Greatest Legacy which requires a whole team without Legacy to be lower then ten health. &nbsp; Some unlocks I would hope people wouldn't intentionally try in a random group in Multiplayer like Young Legacy, DW Fixer, Comsic Omnitron, or Bomber Blade as those can drag out a game. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
